# =============================================================================
# Blackhellheim ASP.NET Core Web API - repository .gitignore
#
# Kept under version control on purpose:
#   - Blackhellheim.slnx and every *.csproj
#   - API/, Core/ and Infraescructure/ source code
#   - API/Blackhellheim.Api/appsettings.json and appsettings.Development.json
#   - API/Blackhellheim.Api/Properties/launchSettings.json
#   - API/Blackhellheim.Api/Dockerfile and docker-compose.yaml
#   - EF Core migrations, model snapshots and *.Designer.cs files (when added)
#   - docs/, README.md, .vscode/settings.json and .env.example
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. .NET / ASP.NET Core build artifacts
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Dd]ebug/
[Rr]elease/
x64/
x86/
